# 原生人像引擎：构建目录、放入资源目录的动态库、本地下载的完整 ORT 包
native/portrait-engine/build/
native/portrait-engine/third_party/onnxruntime-win-*/
native/portrait-engine/_ref_*.rs
src-tauri/resources/portrait-engine/
